[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4071011573","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117487#issuecomment-4071011573","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117487","id":4071011573,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7yprT1","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-16T22:24:33Z","updated_at":"2026-03-16T22:24:33Z","body":"I think this is not a bug, you call `child.reparent` during the `_process` call which make the node become unparented to be reparented after. `_process` is only called for nodes inside the tree during the internal call. Moving the `reparent` call to `_physics_process` or using `child.call_deffered(\"reparent\", node)` works as you would expect.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4071011573/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://